    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Represents options to purchase shares of the Issuer's Series A Common Stock granted pursuant to the Settlement Agreement (as defined in Footnote 3).</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">The options vested as to 20% on the grant date and vest as to an additional 20% on each of the first four anniversaries thereof.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">Reflects the disposition of options to purchase shares of the Issuer's Series B Common Stock (&quot;FWONB&quot;), pursuant to the Stock Option Award and Settlement Agreement, dated as of November 4, 2026, between the Reporting Person and the Issuer (the &quot;Settlement Agreement&quot;), in connection with the closing of the exchange contemplated by the Exchange Agreement, dated as of November 4, 2026, among the Issuer and the persons named therein (the &quot;Closing&quot;). Following the Closing, pursuant to the Settlement Agreement, on November 9, 2026, the options vested in full and were cancelled in exchange for a cash payment of $17.74 per share underlying the options, less applicable tax withholding, representing the excess of the fair market value of a share of FWONB on November 9, 2026 over the exercise price of the options.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">On May 12, 2026, the Issuer reincorporated from a corporation incorporated under the laws of the State of Delaware to a corporation incorporated under the laws of the State of Nevada by means of a plan of conversion. At the effective time of the conversion, any option to purchase shares of the Issuer's Series B Liberty Formula One Common Stock of the Delaware Corporation automatically converted into a corresponding award with respect to the same number of shares of Series B Common Stock of the Nevada Corporation with the same terms. The conversion did not alter the proportionate interests of security holders.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F5">Represents options to purchase shares of the Issuer's Series C Common Stock granted pursuant to the Settlement Agreement.</footnote>
    </footnotes>

